&lt;div class="hero-tag"&gt;Election intelligence&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;North Carolina elections, organized into a clear visual story.&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore turnout, county-level vote share, and political patterns in a polished dashboard built for quick reading and presentation. This project turns raw election data into an easy-to-follow narrative.&lt;/p&gt;
